  "display_title": "The S-Class Baby Princess Is Too Powerful",
  "description": "Princess Anatrisha is only a year old, but her life is already far too complicated. Her father, the emperor, is cold and distant, and her mother is nowhere to be seen. Her older brother, meanwhile, is bullied by other nobles. Luckily, Anatrisha was an S-class hunter in her past life and is set on using her skills and magic to protect her loved ones. Can this little princess defend her right to the throne and bring her family closer together? Or will it be game over for this S-class baby?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
